// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_SG_TI_Mission_1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1170243457" "I have received information that a heist was planned in Talos Island by the Tsoo. <a href={ACCEPT}>I need your help in thwarting this attack!</a> The Tsoo have been reported to be in the bank right now, so you should head over there quick. You probably have about 5 minutes or less before they make their escape. <br><br><color orange>This is a Safeguard mission. Once you prevent the heist, you will have 15 minutes to explore the area and potentially earn extra rewards before the P.P.D. lock down the area. You can earn extra time by defeating vandals and completing side missions, however you can lose time if they destroy too much of the city.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P494819743" "Protect Talos Island bank"
// SendOffString :
"P3022475013" "It gets worse. It seems that Arachnos has learned about the operation, and has decided to send teams into Talos Island to take advantage of the situation and sew terror on their own. While your main goal is to stop the villain and the robbery, the more of any villain group you defeat, the more help you will be to the P.P.D.<br><br><color orange>Periodically, vandals will arrive to destroy parts of the city. You will see a message when they arrive, and their locations will be displayed in your minimap.</color>"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2923535081" "Talos Island is still under attack!"
// DeclineString :
"P737905035" "Sorry, can't help you this time."
// DeclineSendOffString :
"P3311727586" "What?! I understand, {HeroName}. You no doubt have some very important things to do. We'll do our best to stop them, but it doesn't look good."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1726834193" "Arachnos squads are everywhere, and the Tsoo appearing to be standing guard at key sites, and trashing other areas. People are terrified, and right now you may be the city's only hope."

